%% Sprint Mini Player 3 (MP3) - Spotify OAuth popup fallback sequence (RF-06 / ADR-194).
%% Happy path (popup OK) vs Fallback (popup blocked OR closed<1.5s) -> sessionStorage + full-page redirect.
%% TTL 10min no snapshot. Restore via /spotify-callback page.

sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Coach-AI Prefs<br/>(SpotifyConnectionPanel)
    participant Auth as auth.ts<br/>initiateSpotifyAuth
    participant Snap as oauthSnapshot.ts<br/>(novo)
    participant SS as sessionStorage<br/>spotify_oauth_snapshot
    participant Win as window.open
    participant Spotify as accounts.spotify.com
    participant Callback as /spotify-callback page
    participant Server as POST /api/audio/spotify/oauth-callback
    participant LS as localStorage<br/>audio.queue.v1

    User->>UI: Click "Conectar Spotify"
    UI->>Auth: initiateSpotifyAuth()

    Note over Auth,Snap: Proactive snapshot save<br/>(antes de window.open<br/>para garantir state preservado<br/>se popup blocked)

    Auth->>Snap: saveOAuthSnapshot(authUrl)
    Snap->>LS: read queue.version
    Snap->>SS: setItem('spotify_oauth_snapshot',<br/>{activeTrackId, scrollY,<br/>queueVersion, timestamp,<br/>authUrl})

    Auth->>Win: window.open(authUrl, '_blank', 'popup')

    alt Happy Path: popup nao-null + abriu OK
        Win-->>Auth: popup Window object
        Auth->>Auth: setTimeout(checkClosed, 1500)
        User->>Spotify: autoriza (popup)
        Spotify->>Callback: redirect ?code=...&state=...
        Callback->>Server: POST /oauth-callback {code, state}
        Server-->>Callback: 200 {success} + Set-Cookie spotify_session
        Callback->>Win: window.opener.postMessage({type:'spotify_oauth_success'})
        Win->>Auth: postMessage event (resolved=true)
        Auth->>SS: removeItem('spotify_oauth_snapshot')
        Auth->>UI: connectSpotify() (driver ready)
        Win->>Win: window.close()

    else Branch A: popup === null (Chrome blocker sync)
        Win-->>Auth: null
        Auth->>Auth: detect popup blocked
        Auth->>Win: window.location.href = authUrl<br/>(FULL-PAGE REDIRECT)
        Note over Win: React state lost.<br/>Queue local intact (ADR-193).<br/>Snapshot preserva activeTrack + scrollY.
        User->>Spotify: autoriza (full page)
        Spotify->>Callback: redirect ?code=...&state=...
        Callback->>Server: POST /oauth-callback {code, state}
        Server-->>Callback: 200 {success} + Set-Cookie spotify_session
        Callback->>Callback: window.opener === null<br/>=> mode = 'redirect'
        Callback->>Snap: restoreOAuthSnapshot()
        Snap->>SS: getItem('spotify_oauth_snapshot')

        alt TTL OK (< 10min)
            SS-->>Snap: snapshot JSON
            Snap->>SS: removeItem (consumed)
            Snap-->>Callback: {scrollY, activeTrackId}
            Callback->>Callback: setTimeout(<br/>  window.scrollTo(0, scrollY),<br/>  100ms)
            Callback->>UI: redirect to "/" (home)
            UI->>LS: AudioPlayerProvider boot<br/>re-hydrate queue
            Note over UI: activeTrack NAO auto-play.<br/>User precisa clicar play (UX sanity).
        else TTL expirou (> 10min)
            SS-->>Snap: snapshot JSON (timestamp old)
            Snap->>SS: removeItem (discarded)
            Snap-->>Callback: null
            Callback->>UI: redirect to "/" (sem restore)
        end

    else Branch B: popup Safari async-close (<1.5s)
        Win-->>Auth: popup object (parecia OK)
        Auth->>Auth: setTimeout 1500ms
        Note over Win: Safari fechou popup<br/>sem postMessage.<br/>(user redirecionou pra Spotify<br/>mas backed out)
        Auth->>Win: setTimeout callback:<br/>popup.closed && !resolved<br/>=> detect blocked
        Auth->>Win: window.location.href = authUrl<br/>(FULL-PAGE REDIRECT)
        Note over Win,Callback: Mesmo fluxo da Branch A<br/>restore via /spotify-callback

    else Branch C: User cancela OAuth na Spotify
        User->>Spotify: click "Cancel"
        Spotify->>Callback: redirect ?error=access_denied
        Callback->>Callback: detect query ?error=
        Callback->>UI: render SpotifyOAuthErrorDialog<br/>data-testid=spotify-oauth-error-dialog<br/>mensagem PT-BR: "Voce cancelou a autorizacao."
        Callback->>UI: telemetria spotify_oauth_error<br/>{reason: 'access_denied'}
        User->>UI: click [Reconectar]
        UI->>Auth: initiateSpotifyAuth() (loop)
        User->>UI: OR click [Cancelar]
        UI->>UI: redirect "/" (home)
    end

    Note over Auth,Callback: Snapshot fields:<br/>activeTrackId: string|null<br/>scrollY: number<br/>queueVersion: number (ADR-193)<br/>timestamp: number (ms)<br/>authUrl: string<br/>NAO contem secrets (sem tokens/JWT)
